---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Check your inbox"
description: "Confirm your email to get day 1."
permalink: /thanks/
noindex: true
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import slot, signupBox, signupForm, vcard with context %}
<section class="page-head">
  <h1 data-reveal>Check your inbox.</h1>
  <p class="intro-line" data-reveal style="--i:1">Check your email and tap the confirm link to get day 1.</p>
</section>
<section class="split" aria-labelledby="wait-h">
  <div class="l" data-reveal>
    <h2 id="wait-h" class="bigtext" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">While you wait</h2>
    {% if collections.videos | length %}
    <div class="cards" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      {{ vcard(collections.videos[0], 0) }}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p>New videos are on the way.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="r prose" data-reveal style="--i:1">
    {% if site.membershipLaunched %}
    <p>And if you ever want more, members get a longer session from me every week.</p>
    <p><a class="arrow-link" href="/join/">See what's in it</a></p>
    {% endif %}
    <p><a class="arrow-link" href="/watch/">Keep watching</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
